# =====================================================================
# Datasets and run artifacts — never committed.
#
# The remote is PUBLIC and the datasets carry per-subject clinical
# metadata (Height_m, Mass_kg, BiologicalSex, ImpairedLeg) for Stroke,
# Parkinson's, hip-OA and gait-retraining cohorts. Keep them out.
#
# The previous version of this file predated several of these
# directories, so `git add -A` would have staged ~420 GB.
# =====================================================================

